    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "calling a supervisor? i already did that. three times. they just put me on hold for forty minutes and then hang up. it's like they're actively ignoring me. every time i try to fight back, the system just pushes me down harder. it's not even about the housing anymore, it's just this heavy feeling that no matter what i do, i'm just wasting my breath. i'm just letting myself be erased.",
