      "content": "exactly. it's just... it's exhausting. i wake up and i already feel like i've lost. there's no point in fighting something that's basically a wall. it feels like the only way to actually stop the cycle and just have some peace is to just stop trying altogether. like, why keep playing a game that's rigged so i can't win?",
